OL,3,ATop South African policeman charged
OL,4,Awith sexual offences
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne of South Africa's highest ranking
OL,7,Fpolice officers has been charged with
OL,8,Fsexual offences at a brief appearance
OL,9,Fat a court north-west of Johannesburg.
OL,11,FThe charges relate to allegations that
OL,12,FLt Gen Shadrack Sibiya sexually groomed
OL,13,Fa 16-year-old girl and raped an
OL,14,F18-year-old woman. He is also facing a
OL,15,Fcharge of trafficking, which could mean
OL,16,Fthat others may be arrested in relation
OL,17,Fto this case.
OL,19,FThe suspended deputy police
OL,20,Fcommissioner, who was detained on
OL,21,FMonday, has made no comment.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
