OL,3,ATop South African policeman charged
OL,4,Awith sexual offences
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe 59-year-old is due to appear in
OL,7,Fcourt again on 29 September for a bail
OL,8,Fapplication. Prosecutors are expected
OL,9,Fto oppose bail.
